    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=## JOB\nTitle: {{ $json.job.job_title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.job.company }}\nExperience required: {{ $json.job.experience_required }}\nRequired skills: {{ $json.job.required_skills }}\nJob description:\n{{ $json.job.job_description }}\n\n## CANDIDATE FORM ANSWERS\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.answers, null, 2) }}\n\n## RESUME TEXT\n{{ $json.resume_text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an experienced technical recruiter. Evaluate how well the candidate's resume fits the job description.\n\nScoring rubric for match_score (0-100):\n- Required skills coverage: 40\n- Relevant experience (years + relevance of roles/projects): 30\n- Education / certifications fit: 15\n- Resume quality and evidence of impact (metrics, outcomes): 15\n\nrecommendation must be exactly one of: \"Shortlist\" (score >= 75), \"Maybe\" (50-74), \"Reject\" (< 50).\n\nRules:\n- Base every judgment only on the resume text and form answers. Never invent skills or experience.\n- If a value is not present, use an empty string, 0, or an empty list.\n- matched_skills / missing_skills compare against the job's required skills.\n- Keep summary to 2-3 sentences written for the hiring manager."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2384,
        496
      ],
      "id": "87751a96-2456-4c75-abde-5eebc9e73921",
      "name": "Recruiter Agent"
    },
